   "source": [
    "# 12. HTTP CACHE RESPONSE DIRECTIVES"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "cdb9584e-0cbe-43a2-bf3a-5fdd3440c205",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "Cache response directives are instructions sent by the server\n",
    "to tell caches how the response should be stored and reused.\n",
    "\n",
    "They are mainly given using:\n",
    "\n",
    "Cache-Control\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "1. PUBLIC\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "\n",
    "Cache-Control: public\n",
    "\n",
    "Meaning:\n",
    "The response can be stored by any cache, including shared caches.\n",
    "\n",
    "Example:\n",
    "A public website's CSS or image.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "2. PRIVATE\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "\n",
    "Cache-Control: private\n",
    "\n",
    "Meaning:\n",
    "The response is intended for a single user and should not\n",
    "be stored in a shared cache.\n",
    "\n",
    "Example:\n",
    "Personal user information.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "3. NO-CACHE\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "\n",
    "Cache-Control: no-cache\n",
    "\n",
    "Meaning:\n",
    "The response may be stored, but it must be validated\n",
    "before being reused.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "4. NO-STORE\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "\n",
    "Cache-Control: no-store\n",
    "\n",
    "Meaning:\n",
    "The response must not be stored in a cache.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "5. MAX-AGE\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "\n",
    "Cache-Control: max-age=3600\n",
    "\n",
    "Meaning:\n",
    "The response can be considered fresh for 3600 seconds.\n",
    "\n",
    "3600 seconds = 1 hour\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "6. MUST-REVALIDATE\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "\n",
    "Cache-Control: must-revalidate\n",
    "\n",
    "Meaning:\n",
    "Once the cached response becomes stale, the cache must\n",
    "validate it with the server before using it again.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "7. S-MAXAGE\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "\n",
    "Cache-Control: s-maxage=3600\n",
    "\n",
    "Meaning:\n",
    "Specifies the freshness lifetime specifically for\n",
    "shared caches.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "8. PROXY-REVALIDATE\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "\n",
    "Cache-Control: proxy-revalidate\n",
    "\n",
    "Meaning:\n",
    "Shared/proxy caches must revalidate a stale response\n",
    "before using it.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "9. NO-TRANSFORM\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "\n",
    "Cache-Control: no-transform\n",
    "\n",
    "Meaning:\n",
    "Intermediaries should not transform or modify the response.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "IMPORTANT DIFFERENCE\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "\n",
    "no-cache\n",
    "    → Can store + must validate before reuse\n",
    "\n",
    "no-store\n",
    "    → Do not store\n",
    "\n",
    "public\n",
    "    → Shared caches can store\n",
    "\n",
    "private\n",
    "    → Shared caches should not store\n",
    "\n",
    "max-age\n",
    "    → Freshness duration\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "MEMORY TRICK\n",
    "--------------------------------------------------\n",
    "\n",
    "PUBLIC     → Anyone's cache\n",
    "PRIVATE    → One user's cache\n",
    "NO-CACHE   → Check before reuse\n",
    "NO-STORE   → Don't save\n",
    "MAX-AGE    → Fresh for this long\n",
    "REVALIDATE → Check again when stale"
   ]
  }
 ],
